--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party and bundled-asset policy
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository deliberately ships NO .docx templates, NO fonts and NO
student reports. Templates used by tests are generated at runtime from code
(tests/fixtures/build_fixture_template.py), so no third-party document or
font asset is redistributed here.

Runtime dependencies (installed separately, not bundled):
  - python-docx  (MIT)
  - PyYAML       (MIT)
  - Pillow       (HPND)
  - pywin32      (PSF, Windows only, optional)

Placeholder images are generated at runtime with Pillow using a font that is
already installed on the user's machine; no font binary is redistributed.
